   "start": {
    "ayah": 5
   },
   "prompt": "Interior of a bare old mud-brick room at deep night, seen straight on: a small opening in a thick rough wall closed by two solid old wooden plank shutters, no glass, shutters tightly shut with only a thin gap of dark night sky and a few faint stars showing between them. Beyond the gap, far away in the open dark desert, one tiny faint warm glow of a spouted Arabian clay oil lamp, nothing else out there: no buildings, no towers, no minarets, no domes, no mosque, no skyline. Empty room, no people, no figures, no hands, no text, no letters, no glass window, no glass lantern. Quiet, still, mysterious mood."
